# Phase 2 / SEC-02 — disable 3-way merge driver on SOPS-encrypted ciphertext.
# Git's text merge corrupts the MAC/IV blocks at conflict boundaries, producing
# files that decrypt-fail silently (RESEARCH Pitfall 5). Treating these paths
# as `-text` forces conflicts to surface as "binary differ" prompts, which the
# `docs/RUNBOOKS/sops-edit.md` playbook (Plan 02-04) walks through.
.secrets/**/*.yaml -text
